<!--
  Imagina Cloud hooks (IMAGINA.md). New file, so updates of Nextcloud never conflict with it.
  Empty defaults keep Nextcloud's own behaviour; the "imagina" flavor fills them from
  imagina/imagina.properties (imagina/flavor.gradle).
-->
<resources>
